				},
				"string" : "This notebook connects Glamorous Toolkit to the AL checkout at /path/to/AL-Ex. Run the steps yourself in order. The setup snippets have been written but not executed or tested end to end.\n\nGT's MCP endpoint on port 3030 lets Codex work with GT. The Elixir bridge uses a separate framed TCP connection; this notebook uses port 4040."
			},
