				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "Start the bridge listener in IEx\n\n```elixir\nGtBridge.start_listener(4040)\n```\n\nExpect {:ok, pid}. AL.Application does not start this listener automatically. If the port is already in use, check whether this AL runtime already has a listener; otherwise choose another free port and use the same number below. Leave 3030 assigned to GT's MCP server."
