				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "The runtime check should report true, the bridge version, and /path/to/AL-Ex. Inspect alBridge to explore its Code Browser view. This confirms you connected to the intended AL runtime before running programs.\n\nAL's GT package maps AL.Object values to ALObject proxies. The local lib/AL/gt_bridge.ex contributes Examine and Constraint Graph views; ALObject contributes Methods. Use an existing AL.Object returned by your program to explore these views. Programs and examples are in lib/examples; some change persistent state, so choose them deliberately."
			},
