				},
				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "Troubleshooting\n\n• Unknown BeamLinkApplication: load Gt4beam through AL's baseline first.\n• Connection refused: keep IEx running and use the same port on both sides.\n• Address in use: a listener already owns the port. On Linux, inspect it with `ss -ltnp 'sport = :4040'`. Reuse the correct runtime, exit the older IEx, or choose a free port on both sides.\n• Missing Eval module on connection: encountered with gt_bridge 0.17.3. Use the current dependency, run mix deps.get, and restart IEx. Removing deps and _build alone preserves the version in mix.lock.\n• Protocol errors: align the GT and Elixir bridge versions; #dev does not validate compatibility.\n• Missing AL views: load AL's GT package and inspect an actual AL.Object proxy.\n\nThe bridge's own documentation can be loaded below."
			},
