				},
				"string" : "Maintaining this notebook\n\nThis database lives in AL-Ex/lepiter. Load it with BaselineOfAL loadLepiter, or BaselineOfAL loadLepiterFrom: aCheckoutDirectory for a local checkout. Edit the bundled page in GT and review the resulting .lepiter changes with the corresponding code changes.\n\nThe initial connection was verified interactively by the user. This is a setup and exploration guide; a complete GUI demonstration remains to be developed. Sources: README.md, mix.exs, src/BaselineOfAL, src/AL/ALObject.class.st and lib/AL/gt_bridge.ex."
			},
